      "arabic": "١١٨٢٣- نفيسة:\nجارية زينب بنت جحش، وهبتها للنبيّ ﵌ لما رضي عليها بعد أن كان غضب عليها وهجرها شهرا، سمّاها علي بن أحمد بن يوسف في كتاب أخبار النّساء، وأصل القصّة عند أحمد ولم يسمّها.",
      "english": "11823—Nafisa:\nA female slave of Zaynab bint Jahsh. Zaynab gave her to the Prophet—may Allah bless him and grant him peace—when he became pleased with Zaynab again, after having been angry with her and having stayed away from her for a month. Ali ibn Ahmad ibn Yusuf identified her by name in his book Akhbar al-Nisa'. The basic account is recorded by Ahmad, but he did not name her.",
